{"idx": 7, "value": "AQYAACARDwAAAgAAAAEDAAAAAQAAAAQAAAAAAAAAAADwPwAAAAAAAABAAAAAAAAACEAAAAAAAAAQQAAAAAAAABRAAAAAAAAAGEAAAAAAAADwPwAAAAAAAABAAQMAAAABAAAABAAAAAAAAAAAABxAAAAAAAAAIEAAAAAAAAAiQAAAAAAAACRAAAAAAAAAJkAAAAAAAAAoQAAAAAAAABxAAAAAAAAAIEA="}
